                "FT390"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "FT391",
          "criteria": [
            {
              "id": "FT391.admit",
              "text": "bench commit and a bench worktree land with --spec admit an unbound change that carries one tickets-only folder with exactly one ticket, when every production path stays inside that ticket's Writes line."
            },
            {
              "id": "FT391.guards",
              "text": "A light-path change still cannot change the commitment policy or a pinned roadmap row, and a spec-less landing of it refuses with the --spec route."
            },
            {
              "id": "FT391.drain",
              "text": "The operating guide and the drain dispatch each kept light-path fix to a fresh write delegate, whatever the active commitment is, and ADR 0028 records that the commitment gates spec implementations only."
            }
          ],
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "FT391",
              "path": "roadmap/FT391.md",
              "identity": "sha256:2af62a00f72899c536f35c860a09108cac4be53b3815ceedb959e64b48722528"
            }
          ],
          "deliverables": [
            {
